# Dantooine, the battle of Khoonda and away (TSL, 602DAN, 601DAN, 003EBO):
# Zherron's battle plans finalised (ready, no speech; Khoonda's defences
# left as they stood: DSimpson, whatever is done, the side chosen wins),
# Azkul in Khoonda's hall told he can still back away, Vrook come to fight
# beside the Exile, the mercenaries fought, the Administrator's reward
# left to rebuild Khoonda (LSP), Vrook's word after the battle (asked
# through) and his form taught, and back aboard the Ebon Hawk (no Visas
# Marr there yet: her ambush follows the Ravager's scene, not seen).
# Starts from the attack's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @dantooine_attack data/routes/tsl/dantooine_battle.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "The Mercenary Attack" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
say I'm ready to finalize the battle plans. # Zherron
say I'm certain. I've done all I can.
say I'm ready!
use npc_zherron
talk
talk                 # Azkul in the hall, Vrook come to help
fight 120            # the mercenaries
say I am happy to help. # the Administrator's thanks, and her reward
say Please keep the credits # left to rebuild Khoonda (LSP)
talk
talk                 # Vrook's word after the battle
talk
exit To_601          # out to the landing pad
module 601dan
to to_ebonhawk       # aboard the Ebon Hawk
module 003ebo        # the galaxy map next
save dantooine_done
